  "narrative": {
    "intro": "New Mexico has $1.6B in federal contract obligations in FY2027 to date. Federal contract obligations fell 90.2% year over year. The Department of Energy accounted for the largest share of FY2027 to date obligations with $1.5B. TRIAD NATIONAL SECURITY, LLC received $875M and NATIONAL TECHNOLOGY & ENGINEERING SOLUTIONS OF SANDIA, LLC received $633M in FY2027 to date. Facilities Support Services is the largest industry by obligations in FY2027 to date with $1.5B. Award activity in FY2027 to date includes 407 awards with an average award size of $3.8M. Obligations by fiscal year prior to FY2027 were $11.7B in FY22, $12.4B in FY23, $13.1B in FY24, $13.5B in FY25, and $15.8B in FY26. All figures are contract obligations; current-year totals are partial (fiscal year to date).",
