        "heading": "How large is federal contract spending in New Mexico this fiscal year?",
        "body": "New Mexico has $1.6B in federal contract obligations in FY2027 to date. Federal contract obligations fell 90.2% year over year. New Mexico recorded 407 awards so far in FY2027 to date with an average award size of $3.8M."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Which agencies and vendors dominate federal buying in New Mexico?",
        "body": "The Department of Energy obligated $1.5B in FY2027 to date. TRIAD NATIONAL SECURITY, LLC received $875M and NATIONAL TECHNOLOGY & ENGINEERING SOLUTIONS OF SANDIA, LLC received $633M in FY2027 to date. Facilities Support Services accounted for $1.5B in industry obligations in FY2027 to date."
      }
